---
import site from '../data/site.json';
const waLink = `https://wa.me/${site.brand.whatsapp}?text=${encodeURIComponent('Halo EmasAji, saya mau daftar kursus mengemudi')}`;
---

<section class="section cta-final">
  <div class="container cta-final__box" data-reveal>
    <h2>Siap pegang kendali penuh atas kendaraan Anda?</h2>
    <p>Konsultasi gratis, tanpa komitmen. Kami bantu tentukan paket yang paling pas untuk Anda.</p>
    <a href={waLink} class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Chat via WhatsApp</a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cta-final__box {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 72px 24px;
    border: 1px solid var(--gold);
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, rgba(236, 216, 16, 0.08), transparent 60%);
  }
  .cta-final__box h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .cta-final__box p {
    margin: 20px auto 32px;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 460px;
  }
</style>
